units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.308
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target block 0 20 0 20 -55 -15 units lattice
region simbox block 0 20 0 20 -55 20 units lattice
create_box 2 simbox
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 2 region target
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb Nb
mass 1 92.90638
mass 2 92.90638
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
group projectile region projectile
group target region target
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 10
velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 -20.0 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
dump 1 all custom 5000 dump.spall.* id type x y z vx vy vz
run 10
